No source code from that project is copied into this repository. Its published
behaviour was studied, and the capability set was reimplemented against the
documented DSH service contracts with a deliberately different architecture:
dsh-multi-root adds a prompt section and a tool, and never replaces the
`fs` or `sandbox` providers, never disables an upstream loader row, and never
throws from `apply()`.

The names `DeepSeek Harness`, `DSH` and `@deepseek-ai/*` refer to software by
DeepSeek. This project is not affiliated with or endorsed by DeepSeek.
